A libre 2D plotter controller, at [[inkcut.org|https://inkcut.org/]]. Runs a [[Vinyl Cutter]] without Adobe Illustrator.

Used with the Roland GX-24 in [[Pi-Top + AxiDraw = Libre Drawing Machine]].
